OL,4,CParents cutting basics at Christmas,   
OL,5,Ccharity warns                          
OL,6,GChristmas is likely to see families    
OL,7,Gcut back on essentials to try and meet 
OL,8,Gthe expenses of the festive period, a  
OL,9,GWest Sussex soup kitchen has warned.   
OL,11,FKatrina McCormack, chief executive of  
OL,12,Fthe Shout Worthing Soup Kitchen, told  
OL,13,FBBC Radio Sussex that they are forced  
OL,14,Fto limit the amount of support they    
OL,15,Fcan give due to high demand at         
OL,16,FChristmas, and make sure their shelves 
OL,17,Fare stocked.                           
